    "readTime": "7 min read",
    "excerpt": "Compare double hung and casement windows. We help Seattle homeowners choose the right style for ventilation, views, and climate needs.",
    "coverImage": "/wp-media/uploads/2026/11/casement-windows-vs-double-hung-windows-1.jpg",
    "coverAlt": "Casement Windows vs. Double Hung Windows",
