    "coverImage": "/wp-media/uploads/2026/03/soundproof-windows-and-acoustic-door-in-a-modern-urban-living-space-emphasizing-comfort-and-tranquility-f2ad42f8-49c1-4565-a84f-b5673ee5a572.jpg",
