    "excerpt": "Today, I learned how energy-efficient windows can enhance comfort and cut costs. Explore how these windows improve insulation and reduce your energy bills!",
    "coverImage": "/wp-media/uploads/2026/03/modern-home-with-energy-efficient-windows-highlighting-sustainability-and-comfort-5ccd1ea5-9a3b-4a8a-9c97-3631d53bebcd.jpg",
    "coverAlt": "Modern home with energy-efficient windows highlighting sustainability and comfort",
