    "coverImage": "/wp-media/uploads/2026/03/modern-seattle-home-featuring-energy-efficient-windows-with-sunlight-highlighting-their-clarity-5e59e12a-6ea3-4c2d-b6cd-60f3e5877d16.jpg",
