    "excerpt": "Maximize your summer experience in Seattle with our expert tips on indoor-outdoor living, natural light, and effective ventilation for ultimate comfort.",
    "coverImage": "/wp-media/uploads/2026/03/bright-living-room-with-energy-efficient-windows-enhancing-natural-light-in-a-seattle-home-fc80ca99-2ffc-4acf-a0a9-b8432947eb1c.jpg",
