    "excerpt": "Want to learn about my window and door replacement costs in Seattle? I provide a detailed pricing guide to help you make informed decisions easily.",
    "coverImage": "/wp-media/uploads/2026/03/modern-home-with-energy-efficient-windows-and-doors-in-seattle-ebe701fe-102c-47ec-8f5f-5fba25be1fcb.jpg",
