    "coverImage": "/wp-media/uploads/2026/02/modern-home-exterior-with-new-windows-and-doors-enhancing-curb-appeal-96640c57-3599-40fc-886d-4c6396778e36.jpg",
    "coverAlt": "Modern home exterior with new windows and doors enhancing curb appeal",
