    "excerpt": "Explore the best window materials for your home with my insightful comparison of vinyl vs fiberglass windows. Make an informed choice for durability and style!",
    "coverImage": "/wp-media/uploads/2026/02/modern-home-featuring-vinyl-wood-fiberglass-and-aluminum-windows-showcasing-energy-efficiency-and-aesthetic-appeal-ffd31e24-45af-4569-aa29-4743c2c3d929.jpg",
    "coverAlt": "Modern home featuring vinyl, wood, fiberglass, and aluminum windows showcasing energy efficiency and aesthetic appeal",
