    "excerpt": "As a Seattle homeowner, I found the process of replacing windows simple with the right guide. Learn valuable insights to enhance your home’s comfort and style.",
    "coverImage": "/wp-media/uploads/2026/02/modern-seattle-home-with-newly-installed-energy-efficient-replacement-windows-113eef9e-cd14-4e70-850d-3d7c7348b092.jpg",
    "coverAlt": "Modern Seattle home with newly installed energy-efficient replacement windows",
