    "tags": [],
    "date": "February 24, 2026",
    "publishedAt": "2026-02-24 19:16:02",
    "readTime": "5 min read",
    "excerpt": "Spring is here! I share my essential tips for readying your windows and doors in Seattle. Keep your home secure and energy-efficient this season!",
    "coverImage": "/wp-media/uploads/2026/02/seattle-home-with-rainproof-windows-and-doors-highlighting-energy-efficiency-and-comfort-096f1283-2c3f-489d-b045-333efd8587e3.jpg",
    "coverAlt": "Seattle home with rainproof windows and doors, highlighting energy efficiency and comfort",
    "author": "Sound View Window & Door",
