    "originalPath": "/uncategorized/rogue-valley-solid-wood-fir-plank-door-installed-in-redmond-wa",
    "content": "<p><img src=\"/wp-media/uploads/2023/06/DSC03250-1024x1024-1-600x600.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p><p>Sound View recently installed this solid wood fir plank door in Redmond, WA. The door was manufactured by Rogue Valley Doors and is model 7026. The door was finished with a clear coat. Installation was completed using 2 x 4 vg fir at the head and 2\" vg fir brick mold on the legs on the exterior trim. The interior trim was completed with 1 x 4 vg fir at the head of the door and 1 x 3 vg fir on the legs. An oak floor transition as also applied.</p><p>For information on installing a new Rogue Valley wood door in your home, please contact Sound View Window & Door at 206-402-4229 or email at <a href=\"mailto:contact@soundviewseattle.com\">contact@soundviewseattle.com</a></p><p><img src=\"/wp-media/uploads/2023/06/DSC03239-001-1024x1024-1-600x600.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p><p><img src=\"/wp-media/uploads/2023/06/DSC03226-1024x1024-1-600x600.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p><p><img src=\"/wp-media/uploads/2023/06/DSC03251-001-1024x1024-1-600x600.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p><iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d42986.17953580606!2d-122.14189495474679!3d47.67206297598102!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x54900cad2000ee23%3A0x5e0390eac5d804f2!2sRedmond%2C%20WA!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1690493062618!5m2!1sen!2sus\" title=\"Embedded content\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>"
