    "originalPath": "/uncategorized/andersen-100-series-casement-windows",
    "content": "<img src=\"/wp-media/uploads/2023/06/AW15-13119_100S_CasementWindow-300x300-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><p>100 Series casement windows are not only low-maintenance and energy-efficient, they’re also available in dark colors both inside and out. Made with revolutionary Fibrex® composite material, this budget-friendly window is the smart alternative to vinyl.</p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2Q2s_spo7zs\" title=\"Embedded content\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>"
