    "seoDescription": "Explore Simpson Doors' Nantucket Collection at Sound View Window & Door in Seattle. Discover durable and beautiful door options. Get a quote today!",
    "originalPath": "/uncategorized/10977-2",
    "content": "<p>SOUND VIEW WINDOW & DOOR offers some fun product facts from one of our favorite local door manufacturers:  Simpson Doors, located in beautiful McCleary, Washington.</p><p><img src=\"/wp-media/uploads/2023/06/unnamed-300x86-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p><p>All Nantucket® Collection exterior doors now have a 10-year warranty with no overhang requirement, even for the toughest of exposures. Which means you can have the beauty of a wood door, at the design and size you need, with long-lasting performance.</p><p>Simpson has engineered their Nantucket Collection with two-piece laminated components and a modified joinery technique to provide long-lasting durability. The Nantucket Collection is offered in either Douglas fir, Sapele Mahogany, or Nootka Cypress wood species, which are proven performers in an exterior exposure.</p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xlq-C1mtKfE\" title=\"Embedded content\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe><br /><strong>The Unmatched Beauty and Flexibility of Wood</strong></p><ul><li>Enjoy the beauty of a wood door, no matter how tough the exposure to elements.</li><li>Select from dozens of door designs, like all-panel doors, French doors and sash designs.</li><li>Create a dramatic design aesthetic with the Black Locust face-driven pins.</li><li>Nearly unlimited design, size and shape capabilities</li></ul><p><img src=\"/wp-media/uploads/2023/06/unnamed3.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p><p><strong>Made to Last - No Matter Where it's Installed</strong></p><ul><li>Made with two-piece solid, laminated stiles and rails - no veneers.</li><li>Modified mortise-and-tenon joinery with face-driven pins eliminate stile-and-rail separation.</li></ul><p><img src=\"/wp-media/uploads/2023/06/unnamed2-300x215-1.png\" alt=\"\" /></p><ul><li>All divided-lite doors made with Simulated Divided Lite (SDL) construction.</li><li>Design pressure ratings of DP50 (additional hardware may be required in some applications).</li><li>Design Options for Any Taste</li><li>Dozens of standard designs available in a wide variety of sizes, and all available either 1¾\" or 2¼\" thick.</li><li>Two sticking profile options and two panel profile options</li><li>Each wood species conveys its own, unique impression and style.</li></ul><p>Homeowners and Contractors: Looking to purchase <strong>Simpson door</strong> products without installation? Sound View offers expert product sales.</p><p>Call us at <strong>206-402-4229 </strong>for a<strong> free estimate</strong> on <strong>Simpson Nantucket doors</strong> for your home, or fill out the online form above and someone from our company will respond in a timely manner.</p><p>Or stop by our <strong>showroom</strong> at <a href=\"http://mapq.st/h/3-u2G7\">2626 15th Ave W, Seattle, WA 98119</a>.</p><p>Sound View sells and installs <strong>Simpson nantucket collection door</strong> products throughout Seattle (98102, 98103,98105, 98106, 98108, 98115, 98116, 98117, 98118, 98122, 98125, 98126, 98133, 98134, 98136, 98144, 98146, 98148, 98166, 98198), Shoreline (98155), Richmond Beach (98177), Tukwila (98188), Skyway (98178), Ballard (98107), Queen Anne (98109, 98119), Magnolia (98199), Tacoma, Everett (98201, 98203, 98204, 98205, 98206, 98207, 98208), Sammamish (97074, 98075), Medina (98039), Edmonds (98020, 98026), Lynnwood (98036, 98037), Duvall (98019), Carnation (98014), Bothell (98011, 98012, 98021), Woodinville (98072, 98077), Mercer Island (98040), Bellevue (98004, 98005, 98006, 98007, 98008), Kirkland (98033, 98034), Redmond (98052, 98053), Issaquah (98027, 98029, Renton (98054, 98055, 98056, 98057, 98058, 98059), Kent (98030, 98031, 98032, 98042), Federal Way (98023, 98003) and surrounding neighborhoods and cities.</p>"
